<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_43204eb005113090db3476895a76cc14f70698fd23b8582928d6dd3b8f43e10b_n0027/gr_0020> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasGradeValue> <http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_C> .
